.Dd $Mdocdate: July 31 2026 $
.Dt APLIC 4 riscv64
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm aplic
.Nd Advanced Platform-Level Interrupt Controller
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Cd "aplic* at fdt?"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
driver supports the Advanced Platform-Level Interrupt Controller
(APLIC) that is part of the RISC-V Advanced Interrupt Architecture.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr imsic 4 ,
.Xr intro 4
.Rs
.%T The RISC-V Advanced Interrupt Architecture version
.%N Version 1.0
.Re
.Sh HISTORY
The
.Nm
driver first appeared in
.Ox 8.0 .
.Sh AUTHORS
.An -nosplit
The
.Nm
driver was written by
.An Mark Kettenis Aq Mt kettenis@openbsd.org .
